</jpcrp030000-asr_E35333-000:NotesRegardingSubsidyIncomeTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E35333-000:NotesRegardingContributionForConstructionEITextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; text-align: left; text-indent: -24px"&gt;※５　工事負担金等受入額及び工事負担金等圧縮額&lt;/p&gt;
